    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"creating meaning\" sounds like such a chore. like we're just playing pretend to distract ourselves from the fact that we're essentially nothing. it feels like we're just performing a script for no audience. it's exhausting to keep pretending that things \"matter\" when the math of the universe suggests otherwise.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
